3. TYPESTATE / FACADES / path.data / np>12
---

## Facades wrap oo_* — PASS
`std/os/fs.oo:16-99` each public op is one `oo_*`.
  read/probe/size/dir/is_dir: `&FsReadCap`
  write/mkdir/remove/link/symlink: `&FsWriteCap`
  `fs_walk` `:50-76` recurse, no depth cap. Residual, named.

`std/os/env.oo:14-16` → `oo_env_get`.
`std/os/process.oo:15-17` `process_args` → `oo_sys_args`.

## C cap re-check — PASS
Every FS/env op in `chs_rt_fs.c` calls require first:

  :42 read_file     oo_cap_require_fsread
  :55 write_file    oo_cap_require_fswrite
  :69 path_exists   oo_cap_require_fsread
  :75 file_size     oo_cap_require_fsread
  :81 env_get       oo_cap_require_env
  :100 fs_read_dir  oo_cap_require_fsread
  :118 fs_is_dir    oo_cap_require_fsread
  :124 fs_remove    oo_cap_require_fswrite
  :134 fs_mkdir     oo_cap_require_fswrite
  :144 fs_hardlink  oo_cap_require_fswrite
  :153 fs_symlink   oo_cap_require_fswrite

Accept exact granular or full FsCap: `chs_rt_sys.c:167-180`.
Env: `chs_rt_sys.c:111-117`.
ProcessCap or legacy SysCap: `chs_rt_sys.c:190-196`, used at `:443`.

Write bound: `to_cpath` + `OODA_FS_WRITEDIR` + `path_under_writedir`
(`chs_rt_fs.c:20-39,54-66`). `/` writedir refused (`:26`).
File write: `openat` + `O_NOFOLLOW` (`:38`).
mkdir/unlink/link/symlink: writedir then raw `mkdir`/`unlink`/`link`/`symlink`.
No `O_NOFOLLOW` (`:130,140,149,158`). Residual, named.

DE1.8 prefix: `chs_rt_sys.c:121-127` (`OODA_` or `OO_`).
Exec inherit same prefix, pointer snapshot `newenv[n++]=*src` (`:269`).
Residual, named.

## Residual raw path.data — PASS (still residual)
  `chs_rt_fs.c:43`  `fopen(path.data, "rb")`          oo_read_file
  `chs_rt_fs.c:70`  `fopen(path.data,"rb")`           oo_path_exists
  `chs_rt_fs.c:76`  `fopen(path.data,"rb")`           oo_file_size
  `chs_rt_fs.c:102` `path.data ? path.data : ""`      oo_fs_read_dir

No `to_cpath`. No PATH_MAX. Embedded NUL shortens. NULL `data` is UB.
`oo_fs_is_dir` uses `to_cpath(..., 1024)` not PATH_MAX (`:119`).
`to_cpath` clamps silent (`:20-22`). Not closed.


